  "body": "* 10-Year Master Build Guarantee\r\n* Dual kitchens & multiple lounges\r\n* Separate granny flat potential\r\n* Smooth indoor-outdoor flow\r\n* Prime convenient location\r\n\r\nPositioned on a generous 524sqm (approx.) section in the popular Millwater community, this impressive brand-new residence offers approximately 332sqm of thoughtfully designed living space. Combining contemporary style with a highly functional layout, the home is ideal for large or multi-generational families seeking both comfort and flexibility. A 10-Year Master Build Guarantee provides additional peace of mind.\r\n\r\nUpon entry, a welcoming lounge sets the tone for the home, offering a quiet space to relax or receive guests. The lower level also features a well-designed two-bedroom granny potential area with its own separate entrance, creating excellent flexibility for extended family, teenagers, guests, or even additional living independence. This area includes a comfortable living space and a modern bathroom, ensuring privacy and convenience.\r\n\r\nUpstairs is the main hub of the home, where light-filled open-plan living, dining, and kitchen areas create an inviting space for everyday family life and entertaining. The stylish main kitchen features quality finishes, generous storage and a large island, while a second kitchen provides added practicality for busy households or those who enjoy cooking and hosting.\r\n\r\nThe indoor living flows seamlessly to a sunny outdoor deck, perfect for summer gatherings, morning coffee, or simply unwinding in the fresh air.\r\n\r\nAccommodation is well considered, with a spacious master suite complete with a walk-in wardrobe and private ensuite. Additional bedrooms are well-sized and serviced by a modern family bathroom. Multiple living areas, including an additional upstairs lounge, provide flexibility for family members to spread out - whether as a media room, children's retreat, or quiet reading space.\r\n\r\nCompleting the home is a double internal-access garage, along with ample storage throughout.\r\n\r\nLocated in the sought-after Millwater neighbourhood, the property enjoys close proximity to local parks, quality schools, motorway access, Silverdale Shopping Centre, and the beautiful Orewa Beach, making everyday living both convenient and enjoyable.\r\n\r\nA spacious, versatile home designed to accommodate modern family living. \r\n\r\nContact Team Vinson and Amy 022 571 7074 today to arrange your private viewing or visit the next open home to experience it for yourself. For more information, and find all you need please visit https://www.vinsonamyandco.nz",
